Cook the @quinoa{1/2%cup} according to the package directions. Set aside to cool slightly.

Prepare the @hummus{1%recipe} (use your favorite recipe or store-bought).

Mix the veggies – In a #bowl{}, combine @cherry tomatoes{1%cup}(halved), @cucumber{1/4%cup}(cut into cubes), @red onion or pickled onions{}, and @fresh dill or parsley{}(chopped). Season with @salt{to taste} and @black pepper{to taste}.

Assemble the bowl – Spoon the quinoa into a bowl. Add the veggie mix, a scoop of hummus, and @Feta cheese{1%cup}(crumbled).

Drizzle with @?yogurt{} or tzatziki{} and a generous splash of good-quality @olive oil{for serving}. Add @?red chili flakes{} if desired. Serve with @pita bread{for serving} or chips.